  "claims": {
    "C3-1": "A test map was authored headlessly by a repeatable commandlet; result JSON reports 8/8 steps ok.",
    "C3-2": "Content/Maps/RxTestMap.umap exists on disk with floor, blocking wall, PlayerStart, sun, skylight.",
    "C3-3": "NEGATIVE CONTROL: an in-script failure is recorded as ok=false with a full traceback, not silently passed.",
    "C3-4": "MEASURED LIMITATION: the pythonscript commandlet exit code does NOT discriminate success (probe_ok exits 1) from success-with-logged-errors; only an uncaught raise differs (255). Exit code is not a usable gate for this project.",
    "C4-1": "The player character is an ACharacter subclass and is the GameMode's DefaultPawnClass; it spawns into the world.",
    "C4-2": "The Enhanced Input mapping context the character depends on resolves.",
    "C5-1": "The character carries a CameraComponent (FOV 90) on a SpringArmComponent (arm length 400).",
    "C6-1": "Movement: CharacterMovementComponent, max_walk_speed 600, gravity_scale 1.0, jump_z 500. Collision: CapsuleComponent r35 hh90, QueryAndPhysics.",
    "C6-2": "Config/DefaultEngine.ini now points GameDefaultMap/EditorStartupMap at RxTestMap and sets GlobalDefaultGameMode; the before-state is preserved."
  },
